request.description:
Lists every seeded role.

**Response 200**
```json
{
  "roles": [
    {
      "id": "uuid",
      "name": "Senior Software Engineer",
      "role_family": "engineering" | "frontline",
      "description": "text injected into the conversation system prompt",
      "created_at": "ISO timestamp"
    }
  ]
}
```
Sets `{{role_id}}` to the first role returned.

