request.description:
Fetches one session plus its latest score version (or `null` if unscored).

**Response 200**
```json
{
  "session": {
    "id": "uuid", "role_id": "uuid", "candidate_name": "string",
    "status": "...", "created_at": "...", "ended_at": "... | null"
  },
  "score": { /* full score row, see Score schema in collection description */ } | null
}
```

**Errors**: `404` — session not found.

Returns the full message transcript in chronological order.

**Response 200**
```json
{
  "messages": [
    { "id": "uuid", "session_id": "uuid", "role": "assistant" | "user", "content": "string", "created_at": "ISO timestamp" }
  ]
}
```

**Errors**: `404` — session not found.

